# Fixes must travel

When a form, navigation, upload, or confirmation bug shows up on one site, fix the **shared behavior** (searchable dropdowns, board pages, file inputs, post-submit success). Do not add a company-name or single-host branch unless the protocol itself is different and the same code path cannot serve the others.

A careers **board or location list** is not a failure. Pick a location-eligible opening that matches the candidate's verified skills and continue the apply. Exact title match is preferred; a credible skill match is still an apply.

Do not mark an application failed because a screenshot or a non-essential widget timed out.
